  english:
    title: A Type Fire Estinguisher
    message: A-type fire extinguishers are used for fires involving solid materials
      such as wood, paper, and fabric. They should be applied by aiming at the base
      of the fire in a controlled manner.
    sound: {fileID: 11400000, guid: da309388d260717498ed39b79686fd45, type: 2}
  turkish:
    title: "A Tipi Yang\u0131n T\xFCp\xFC"
    message: "A tipi yang\u0131n t\xFCpleri, kat\u0131 maddelerden kaynaklanan yang\u0131nlarda
      kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Ah\u015Fap, k\xE2\u011F\u0131t ve kuma\u015F yang\u0131nlar\u0131nda
      etkilidir. Yang\u0131n\u0131n taban\u0131na y\xF6neltilerek kontroll\xFC \u015Fekilde
      uygulanmal\u0131d\u0131r."
    sound: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 556ade5744b553740bf7c49ee9265659, type: 2}
